<title>USA: Staples says likely to end merger attempt.</title>
<headline>Staples says likely to end merger attempt.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Staples Inc will likely end any attempt to merge with Office Depot following a judge's ruling Monday, Staples President Thomas Stempberg said.</p>
<p>&quot;While we ardently disagree with the judge's decision, we respect the judicial process and it is likely we will discontinue our merger plans with Office Depot,&quot; Stemberg said in a statement.</p>
<p>U.S. District Court Judge Thomas Hogan granted a preliminary injunction against the merger which had been sought by the Federal Trade Commission.</p>
